                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>学生叫她</FONT>“老张”，她叫学生“宝贝儿”。她说：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>　　</FONT>“树强宝贝儿，刚认识你时，你的成绩令每个老师摇头叹息。可没多久，老师就发现你也是一颗闪亮的星……”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>　　</FONT>“泽源宝贝儿，老张知道你对电脑‘情有独钟’，但不能上瘾呦……”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>　　</FONT>“舒宁宝贝儿，还记得那次流鼻血吗？可吓坏了老师，所以，你一定要按量喝水，多吃蔬菜，多运动……”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>　　在大山里长大的</FONT>“老张”不老，今年才<FONT face=Calibri>44</FONT><FONT face=宋体>岁。“老张”名叫张建华，是全国教书育人楷模、河北省保定市阜平县大园小学校长，在乡村讲台一扎根就是</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>25</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年。张建华说：“当年要不是老师培养，我不会走出大山。我也要把孩子们送出大山，让他们看看外面的世界。”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>　　走出大山，她又回来教大山里的孩子</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>　　站上讲台那年，张建华</FONT>19<FONT face=宋体>岁。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>　　环顾着讲台下一张张脏兮兮的小脸，一双双充满渴望的大眼睛，她有点兴奋，又有点紧张。人家说在农村当老师苦，何况是河北省阜平县最偏远贫困的大台乡坊里村。苦，咋不苦？土坯房四处漏风，破桌子、烂板凳似乎随时会散架，纸和笔太奢侈，孩子们就用小石板当纸、石笔当笔，淘气的男孩子用袖子擦石板，棉袄</FONT>“刺啦”一声划破了，龇牙咧嘴露着棉花。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>　　孩子们可能想不到，这位从大城市</FONT>“学成归来”的新老师，就是这所小学的毕业生。“看到这些孩子，我就想起自己小时候。我想好好教他们，恨不得把自己所有知识都掏给他们！”张建华暗暗发誓。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>　　山窝窝里，谈何容易？老师不会说普通话，别的学校寻常的品德课、音乐课、美术课、体育课，孩子们没见过，更没学过。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>　　受过正规师范教育的张建华，决定用自己所学开拓一片新天地。她踩着全学校唯一一架</FONT>“高大上”的脚踏琴，教孩子们唱“一闪一闪亮晶晶”；她拿着一头烧得焦黑的柴火棍子，在地上教孩子们画小动物、一笔画；她跳起在师范学过的韵律操，组织起新鲜的体育游戏，教孩子们上“新式”体育课……整个四年级，她“包班”负责<FONT face=Calibri>7</FONT><FONT face=宋体>门课程，天天从早到晚。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
